==== hyperbricks yaml {!{image}} ====
image:
  - type: image
  - height: "320"
  - quality: "1"
  - src: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg
  - width: "320"
==== explainer ====
JPEG quality from 1 to 100; omit or use 0 for 90. Does not affect PNG or GIF encoding.
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
  "Class": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<IMAGE>",
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "Height": 320,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Id": "",
  "IsStatic": false,
  "Loading": "",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "Quality": 1,
  "Src": "hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg",
  "Title": "",
  "Width": 320
}

